# Contexto por allowlist. Arquivos privados nem são enviados ao builder.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!requirements-core.txt
!requirements-asr.txt
!requirements-tts.txt
!server/
!server/*.py
!server/tools/
!server/tools/*.py
!frontend/
!frontend/*.html
!frontend/*.js
!frontend/*.css
!configs/
!configs/system_prompt.example.md
!docker/
!docker/entrypoint.py
!docker/healthcheck.py

# Defesa adicional caso a allowlist seja ampliada.
**/.env*
**/system_prompt.md
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.git/
**/*secret*
**/credentials/
**/backups/
**/models/
**/data/
**/.cache/
**/.venv/
